      "description": "Linked item preview from the directory.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-card\" href=\"#\"><div class=\"ds-card-heading\"><h2>Auth</h2><span class=\"ds-category\">Plugin</span></div><p>Sign-in, sign-out, password recovery and changes, and access-denied states.</p><span class=\"ds-open\">Open plugin <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--border) 70%,transparent);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;background:var(--card);color:var(--card-foreground);text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--font-sans);transition:background-color .15s,border-color .15s}.ds-card-heading{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.ds-card h2{margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:28px;font-weight:600}.ds-category{border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--foreground) 5%,transparent);color:var(--muted-foreground);font:500 12px/16px var(--font-sans)}.ds-card p{flex:1;margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:14px;line-height:1.625}.ds-open{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:24px;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:500;color:var(--primary)}.ds-card:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--primary) 50%,transparent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--primary) 5%,transparent)}.ds-card:hover h2{color:var(--primary)}.ds-card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:2px}@media(min-width:40rem){.ds-card{padding:24px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-card{transition:none}}"
