  "narrative": {
    "overview": "The component workbench is practical, restrained, and easy to scan. It uses neutral backgrounds, teal action accents, a sans-serif type stack, bordered cards, and compact controls. Its shared header and preview frame keep navigation and settings consistent across demos. Customer applications supply their own theme values through the same semantic roles.\n\nCompact and restrained controls keep attention on component behavior. Borders and small shadows create a lightly layered interface. This record preserves the current implementation, including the differences between existing plugins.",
